  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_685538c66d8b4e89b060549fa8dae16b",
      "statement": "The extension's Manifest V3 permission set is declared in `wxt.config.ts` (`storage`, `sidePanel`, `activeTab`, `scripting`, `contextMenus`, `unlimitedStorage`, `declarativeNetRequest`, `favicon`, `clipboardWrite`) together with `optional_host_permissions: ['<all_urls>']`, a localized `default_locale`/`name`/`description`, and the `Alt+Shift+S` `_execute_action` command; the same permission array is copied verbatim into the built `.output/chrome-mv3/manifest.json`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.output/chrome-mv3/manifest.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:cf548b1b17e76f0e7c5dedaf8c274dfc3ea158e22c9e9f7afbb4b5eac9d0b434"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://wxt.config.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:a203b5ccb2d476d44c59e81c9af1cae296bf301373d47c546e3c17deecf6d353"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7b562fc33da24a79a6a5a0d3dd7e224f",
      "statement": "The built manifest contains surface wiring that `wxt.config.ts` does not declare — `action.default_popup: \"popup.html\"`, `side_panel.default_path: \"sidepanel.html\"`, `options_ui: { open_in_tab: true, page: \"options.html\" }`, `background.service_worker: \"background.js\"` and the icon set — because WXT derives these from the `entrypoints/` folders and `public/`, so the config file alone is an incomplete picture of the extension's runtime surface.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.output/chrome-mv3/manifest.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:cf548b1b17e76f0e7c5dedaf8c274dfc3ea158e22c9e9f7afbb4b5eac9d0b434"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://wxt.config.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:a203b5ccb2d476d44c59e81c9af1cae296bf301373d47c546e3c17deecf6d353"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cc3db8049f274536b5ebe97aadc17bdb",
      "statement": "The manifest's static `action.default_popup` is only the `tab`-mode fallback: at runtime `entrypoints/background.ts` calls `browser.action.setPopup({ popup: '' })` when the display setting is `sidepanel`, clearing the manifest default so a toolbar click fires `browser.action.onClicked` instead of opening the popup.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.output/chrome-mv3/manifest.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:cf548b1b17e76f0e7c5dedaf8c274dfc3ea158e22c9e9f7afbb4b5eac9d0b434"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoints/background.ts#L23-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e375120599e66efdff606e415f8acde9519944805480f98ad314b36151435ca3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4a9d2699d8864f48a67c11f2be587a47",
      "statement": "The `storage`, `sidePanel` and `contextMenus` permissions are exercised by concrete code paths: `storage.defineItem` in `lib/settings.ts`, `lib/history.ts`, `lib/models.ts` and `lib/pending.ts`; `browser.sidePanel.setOptions/open` in `lib/pending.ts` and `setPanelBehavior` in `entrypoints/background.ts`; and `browser.contextMenus.create/removeAll` in `lib/context-menus.ts`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoints/background.ts#L16-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d21727e30288f2cf33d293e8a7486ad174d4e1bdadc916643f5570d2e9760c0b:"
        },
        {
