        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://locales/en/settings.json#L112-L115",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:805647ba0307b3f2b51967bceddb9d2860273363c74242142781ddd78b297388:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6dcdc8097bb745a4b0de0244e9f57bdb",
      "statement": "The `declarativeNetRequest` permission exists to support local providers: `allowLocalOrigin` in `lib/local-origin.ts` installs a session rule that rewrites the `Origin` header to the local server's own origin, and the rule is scoped by `urlFilter` to that origin plus `initiatorDomains: [browser.runtime.id]`, so only this extension's own requests are affected and web pages cannot reuse it to bypass the server's origin protection.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/local-origin.ts#L20-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fb2bae8127d9af586774ca3cbe452277a31cff1f0631fb0d66f665ed0d36d7d8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_50fed486c2cb4360bcf3e38da8e01cc5",
      "statement": "The `favicon` and `clipboardWrite` permissions back two UI affordances: `components/SessionView.tsx` renders the source favicon through Chrome's `chrome-extension://<id>/_favicon/?pageUrl=…` cache and copies quotes with `navigator.clipboard.writeText` for the `CopyText` action.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://components/SessionView.tsx#L19-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:60155e79b69baa993df793cbce25be86d0f5a8feff3f977acc5817b7c2787342:"
        },
        {
