    {
      "id": "claim_b96f21b1c0e6451a83f924709c474cdb",
      "statement": "The source content is bounded before it reaches the model: `truncate` in `lib/extractors.ts` cuts the content to `settings.maxChars` (default 60 000) and flags it, and `buildSourceMessage` in `lib/openui.ts` tells the model explicitly that the source was truncated.",
