          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d236c9254cd60cda9923dd43bffbc20ff72076a4411acf26f870f0c709dc652b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bd21c15db2cf48dd887941816519a801",
      "statement": "UI translations live in `locales/<lang>/<namespace>.json` (namespaces `common`, `picker`, `popup`, `session`, `settings`, `errors`) and are bundled at build time by `import.meta.glob` with `eager: true` in `lib/i18n/index.ts`, so the JSON is inlined into the JavaScript bundles rather than fetched at runtime; twelve languages ship, and `matchLanguage`/`browserLanguage`/`resolveUiLanguage` implement the BCP 47 to UI-language mapping with English as the fallback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/index.ts#L12-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:961eabc8bf4bcf8dd151b3fc438f07499f0c56eb33e4af668133084a5cc3555c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/index.ts#L42-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:47ed62eccecd6baf2600fb51b406354c749ffe3ebb177156a92d8e9940416839:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_55b8d73f715144ba91e4d805c3ac3f09",
      "statement": "English is the source of truth for UI strings and its keys are type-checked: `lib/i18n/types.d.ts` augments the `i18next` module with `CustomTypeOptions` whose `resources` are the `typeof` of the six English JSON files, so a `t('settings:model.load')` call for a key missing from English fails to compile.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/index.ts#L30-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3b580d3d281b653973ac8e47db942a6311aeb83e322604b1fdca92e9b07f85b8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/i18n/types.d.ts#L1-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:934ca58c8a997813eea8c9b184ed8fc9f640208ee87724c876c5b7598b286252:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_24611aa377d64b94a855959d2cd0d361",
      "statement": "Chrome-level strings live in a separate tree, `public/_locales/<lang>/messages.json`, using Chrome's underscore directory convention (`pt_BR`, `zh_CN`, `zh_TW`); they provide the extension name, description, toolbar tooltip, command description and the context-menu titles, the latter read through `browser.i18n.getMessage` with an English fallback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/context-menus.ts#L4-L6",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bfc508cf60f895f5600bbe5a46a1f727a3bfe974b75d017b6d840790e49c2b9a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://public/_locales/en/messages.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:f52124332573baacf70836a66f76c6087a93358b28b6aafc2e6873cbd3887300"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://wxt.config.ts#L6-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9b6ea94dcff9399f34b7da9541beff461a82ab789cac6aa96af88183da612ff7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f552c0fbe24e4358adbf63d68c40a1b5",
      "statement": "`pnpm check:i18n` (`scripts/check-locales.mjs`) fails the build on locale drift by verifying, against English, that every key exists and no extra key was added, that a pluralised key supplies exactly the CLDR categories its language needs (computed with `Intl.PluralRules`), that the `{{placeholder}}` sets match, and that no translated value is empty.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/check-locales.mjs#L1-L67",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c31830142657654d6a567a1b2d049db612ba25e918373368be75f7d66b0310cc:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b156dd58668d4f2d82be0d1521b36fb1",
      "statement": "The operational commands are `pnpm dev` (WXT dev server with the extension loaded), `pnpm compile` (`tsc --noEmit`, which is also what enforces the type-checked i18n keys), `pnpm build` (`wxt build`), `pnpm zip` (`wxt zip`) and `pnpm check:i18n`, with `dev:firefox`, `build:firefox` and `zip:firefox` variants; `pnpm build` writes `.output/chrome-mv3/` containing the manifest, the service worker bundle, the four HTML entrypoints, `_locales/`, `icon/`, code-split `chunks/` and `assets/`, and both `.output/` and `.wxt/` are git-ignored so the built manifest is a local artefact rather than a source file.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.gitignore#L12-L15",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d8b6b751135173c6eec3d545ca3d6a5a47a26a4a14d0768082febc9644c5f1a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L8-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a1f726acabc522ed8d92f9a7ba19236dba770926e834ee1b13b1bc30ab83f176:"
        }
      ]
    }
